# Form: defect analysis

Use when a bug's reproduction/cause needs durable explanation, not for every typo.
Default output: `docs/research/<bug>.md` or an existing incident family. A small issue
can contain the same essentials without another file. Copy payload only and fill
[metadata](../../references/metadata.md). Essential: symptom/expected/reproduction,
separated facts/hypotheses, cause or honest unknown, bounded fix/verification. Remove
optional alternatives/timeline, not failure conditions or data-safety boundaries.

